  "slug": "gorealo-applicant-reengagement",
  "name": "GoRealo — Lead re-engagement",
  "description": "Subject: Still exploring a home purchase or refinance? | Preheader: Tell us what changed and we’ll help you pick up where you are.",
  "type": "email",
  "builder": "mailpurse",
  "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Still exploring a home purchase or refinance?</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">Tell us what changed and we’ll help you pick up where you are.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #0BFF56\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/gorealo-logo.png\" width=\"154\" alt=\"GoRealo\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a><p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#003FDA;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">PICK UP WHEN IT WORKS</p><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:#162849\">Your plans can move at your pace.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;margin:0 0 14px\">Hi {{first_name}}, you may still be comparing options—or your plans may have changed. Either way, a short reply can help us point you to a useful next step.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold;margin:0\">Is your goal still on your radar?</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/assets/hero.webp\" alt=\"GoRealo: Lead re-engagement\" width=\"540\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">If you’re ready</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">We can help you review current options and understand the application process.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">If you’re waiting</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">We can share educational resources so you can revisit the decision when it suits you.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">If your plans changed</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Just tell us. We’ll update the conversation around your current goal.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151;margin:22px 0\">Reply with “buy,” “refinance,” “later,” or a question. We’ll tailor our response to where you are.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Warmly,<br><strong>The GoRealo Team</strong></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#003FDA\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/about/contact-us/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Talk with GoRealo</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\"tel:+18667139292\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">1-866-713-9292</a> or reply to this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085;margin:0\">GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "plain_text_content": "Still exploring a home purchase or refinance? Tell us what changed and we’ll help you pick up where you are. MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR PICK UP WHEN IT WORKS Your plans can move at your pace. Hi {{first_name}}, you may still be comparing options—or your plans may have changed. Either way, a short reply can help us point you to a useful next step. Is your goal still on your radar? If you’re ready We can help you review current options and understand the application process. If you’re waiting We can share educational resources so you can revisit the decision when it suits you. If your plans changed Just tell us. We’ll update the conversation around your current goal. Reply with “buy,” “refinance,” “later,” or a question. We’ll tailor our response to where you are. Warmly, The GoRealo Team Talk with GoRealo Prefer to talk? Call 1-866-713-9292 or reply to this email. GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434. 5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256. Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply. Privacy · Unsubscribe",
